{"parse": {"title": "Rod Fishing spot (anglerfish)", "pageid": 276813, "revid": 15304579, "redirects": [], "wikitext": {"*": "{{Otheruses|the fishing spots reachable from land|the fishing spot at sea|Boat fishing spot (anglerfish)}}\n{{Infobox NPC\n|name = Rod Fishing spot\n|image = [[File:Fishing spot new.webp|300px]]\n|release = [[7 January]] [[2016]]\n|update = Zeah: Great Kourend\n|members = Yes\n|location = [[Port Piscarilius]]\n|options = Bait\n|examine = I can see fish swimming in the water.\n|map = No\n|id = 6825\n|leagueRegion = Kourend\n}}\n'''Fishing spots''' can be found on [[Great Kourend]]. These spots, along with the [[Boat fishing spot (anglerfish)|boat fishing spot]] just east of [[Port Piscarilius]], are the only fishing spots where you can fish [[raw anglerfish]]. Anglerfish fishing spots have a highly random movement timer, ranging from as little as 8 ticks (4.8 seconds) up to 830 ticks (approximately 8.3 minutes), making them considered an unreliable AFK fishing option.\n\n==Location==\n{{ObjectTableHead}}\n{{ObjectLocLine\n|name = Fishing spot (anglerfish)\n|location = [[Port Piscarilius]]\n|members = Yes\n|mapID = 0\n|plane = 0\n|x:1826,y:3770|x:1827,y:3770|x:1833,y:3769\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = kourend\n}}\n\n{{ObjectTableBottom}}\n\n==Fish==\n{{Fishing info\n|version1 = Sandworm\n|version2 = Diabolic worm\n|name = Raw anglerfish\n|level = 82\n|xp1 = 120\n|xp2 = 79.2\n|tool = {{plink|Fishing rod}}<br />OR<br />{{plink|Pearl fishing rod}}\n|bait1 = {{plink|Sandworms}}\n|bait2 = {{plink|Diabolic worms}}\n|bucket = No\n}}\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLineSkill|name=Raw anglerfish|quantity=1|rarity=Always|skill=Fishing|level=82}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Tertiary===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{SkillingTertiaryDropLines|skill=fishing|baserate=78649|minlevel=82|maxlevel=99}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n{{Fishing spots}}"}}, "fetchedAt": "2026-10-06T04:22:10.252519+00:00", "dropHtml": "<table class=\"wikitable sortable filterable item-drops autosort